WEBVTT

00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:02.208
Rather amazing.

00:06:04.042 --> 00:06:07.934
And you know, we are, as humans,
obsessed with permanence.

00:06:07.958 --> 00:06:10.083
We resist change.

00:06:11.042 --> 00:06:13.393
It's an impulse that we all have.

00:06:13.417 --> 00:06:16.268
And we resist change in spite of the fact

00:06:16.292 --> 00:06:19.851
that change is perhaps
the only constant in our lives.

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:22.143
Everything has an expiry date,

00:06:22.167 --> 00:06:25.375
including Spaceship Earth, our planet.

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:30.309
So what can we learn
from these sorts of settlements?